          "text": "Nkaambo ciindi cilasika ncobati kaleke kuzumina kufundisya kwinikwini, eno bayoogama kulijanina bafundisi bali mbuli kuyanda kwamyoyo yabo beni, kuti babotelwe kubamvwa. ",
